#: kde3support/kdeui/k3passworddialog.cpp:414
#: kdeui/dialogs/knewpassworddialog.cpp:76
msgid ""
"The password strength meter gives an indication of the security of the password you have entered.  To improve the strength of the password, try:\n"
" - using a longer password;\n"
" - using a mixture of upper- and lower-case letters;\n"
" - using numbers or symbols, such as #, as well as letters."
msgstr ""
"De Meter för de Passwoortstärk gifft en Henwies op de Sekerheit vun dat ingeven Passwoort. Wenn Du dat stärker maken wullt, versöök dit:\n"
" - bruuk en länger Passwoort;\n"
" - misch groot- un lüttschreven Bookstaven;\n"
" - bruuk ok Tallen un Symbolen, as t.B. #."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (KTitleWidget, labelMatch)
